msgid "Example: Kennard-Stone Splitting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/explore/astartes.rst:23
msgid ""
"Here is how you can use ``astartes`` to split your data using the "
"Kennard-Stone algorithm before processing it with ``chemotools``."
msgstr ""

